    featured: false,
    collection: 'Privé Premier Collection',
    desc: 'In the heart of Andalusia, nestled between the gentle hills of the Sierra de Loja, lies Finca La Bobadilla — an exclusive 350-hectare luxury retreat modelled on a charming Andalusian village, and part of The Leading Hotels of the World. Just 45 minutes from Málaga Airport and less than 30 minutes by high-speed train from Granada and Córdoba, this is one of southern Spain\'s most remarkable hideaways. Each of the 73 rooms and suites offers views over ancient olive groves.',
    about: 'In the heart of Andalusia, nestled between the gentle hills of the Sierra de Loja, lies Finca La Bobadilla — an exclusive 350-hectare luxury retreat modelled on a charming Andalusian village, and part of The Leading Hotels of the World. Just 45 minutes from Málaga Airport and less than 30 minutes by high-speed train from Granada and Córdoba, this is one of southern Spain\'s most remarkable hideaways. Each of the 73 rooms and suites offers views over ancient olive groves.',
