    about: 'Set within 231 hectares of ancient olive groves, palm trees, and orange blossoms at the foot of the snow-capped Atlas Mountains, the Fairmont Royal Palm is an oasis of extraordinary scale. 135 rooms, suites, and villas overlook an 18-hole championship golf course designed by Cabell B. Robinson. A 3,500m² Fairmont Spa, four restaurants and two bars, a 2,000 sqm pool — Marrakech\'s largest — the Royal Palm Tennis & Padel Academy, and a fitness center create a destination where guests often stay for the entirety of their visit.',
    courts: '2 Courts',
