    filter: 'asia-pacific',
    featured: false,
    desc: 'Within the spellbinding beauty of the Maldives\' North Malé Atoll lies Patina Maldives, Fari Islands, the first — and flagship — luxury resort under Patina Hotels and Resorts, a transformative luxury brand from the award-winning Capella Hotel Group. Just a 45-min speedboat ride from Malé, sophisticated villas and contemporary studios crafted from nature\'s materials and pure creativity blend harmoniously with breathtaking outdoor spaces, interspersed with a stunning range of 13 culinary concepts that showcase diverse cuisines from Nordic-Japanese fusion to plant-based creations. A private sanctuary that inspires immersive experiences, Patina Maldives is a transcendent journey into a destination of deep cultural character, connecting conscious travellers through originality, discovery and togetherness.',
    courts: '1 Court',
    heroImg: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001178/DJI_0145_p3ovyg.jpg',
    img2: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001171/PATINA-MALDIVES_by_Georg-Roske_Yoga__21_LowRes_cfg48t.jpg',
    collection: 'Privé Partner Collection',
    pills: ['1 COURT', 'JAMES TURRELL SKYSPACE', 'NORTH MALÉ ATOLL'],
    memberBenefits: ['Best Available rate', '$150 USD resort credit per stay (F&B or spa)'],
    amenities: [
      { name: 'Patina Spa', desc: 'Treatment suites featuring couple\'s hammam beds, a room dedicated to the practice of Watsu (water-based therapy), a floatation zone, saunas, cold showers, and a full menu of body treatments. A wellness space designed with the same rigour as the rest of the resort — nothing here is generic.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001601/media_18606f84152255488c2b1ceb83201023aa032452f.png_mkx5gw.webp' },
      { name: 'James Turrell Skyspace & Art Collection', desc: 'Patina Maldives is as much a gallery as a resort. The Fari Art Atelier houses rotating artist residencies; the resort\'s permanent collection features a James Turrell Skyspace installation, photographs by Cássio Vasconcellos, and textiles by Hiroko Takeda.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001729/media_1e2b5d31c919e96c1cfb1c07b61febccd18eda6b7.png_hvwobh.webp' },
      { name: 'Active & Water Sports', desc: 'Free bikes, paddle boards, snorkel sets, and kayaks are included throughout the stay. Padel, yoga classes, beach yoga, sailing, and a 24-hour fitness center complete an active offering designed for guests who want to do as much as they rest.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001725/patina-maldives-islandactivities-surfing-01_e6agp3.png' },
    ],
    accommodations: [
      { num: '01', title: 'Beach Villas', body: 'One and two-bedroom villas with direct beachfront access, each with a private pool set within a garden designed for an unhurried island escape. Floor-to-ceiling windows on three sides, an outdoor oversized bathtub, rain shower, and dining area throughout.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001885/media_1448b733ff2630c55534e231fc34f49b733608de5.jpg_l6xtu6.webp' },
      { num: '02', title: 'Water Villas', body: 'Overwater villas suspended above the Indian Ocean, with panoramic views of the lagoon and marine life through floor-to-ceiling windows on three sides. Each features a private 6.2 metre pool, outdoor oversized bathtub, and a spacious deck — with chance encounters with rays and dolphins from your own terrace.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001876/media_140655735bffc66dcb0dbf538e6614d9fde009cb7.jpg_tcgz0k.webp' },
      { num: '03', title: 'Fari Studios', body: '60 sqm studios set within the Fari Marina Village — a creative community of conscious travellers, artists-in-residence, and wellness practitioners. Private balcony with views of the Indian Ocean and white-sand beach, oversized bathtub, and Haeckels complimentary skincare collection.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001872/media_1b21a0da6c76f618e9e3a56916214a7f97f28dcba.png_d4wvgp.webp' },
      { num: '04', title: 'The Beach House', body: 'A two-storey, 1,800 sqm private estate designed by award-winning architect Marcio Kogan — Patina Maldives\' most exclusive accommodation. Three bedrooms across two levels for up to six adults and three children, with a 21-metre private outdoor pool, enclosed garden, direct beach access, and a west-facing upper deck with uninterrupted sunset views.', img: 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dfjqa5f05/image/upload/q_auto/f_auto/v1776001868/media_1f20a6f49d54f7afd20b9f09d04eb838f10b5a099.jpg_jzaykw.webp' },
    ],
